{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12226770","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226770","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1222677001:1":{"text":"船就在这里，你可以上船。当然，你得付船票的钱。","source_cn":"船就在这里，你可以上船。当然，你得付船票的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7579ECC070CE85B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222677002:1":{"text":"钱？不，你不想要钱。","source_cn":"钱？不，你不想要钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A934AB349C5864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222677003:1":{"text":"说吧，我需要支付什么代价。","source_cn":"说吧，我需要支付什么代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4946074593F7A74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222677004:1":{"text":"聪明，我喜欢。","source_cn":"聪明，我喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80DD212528A9E67B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222677005:1":{"text":"帮我传个口信，带给你背后的主人——那位骸骨之王。","source_cn":"帮我传个口信，带给你背后的主人——那位骸骨之王。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8B1CE6C94A8EFB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222677006:1":{"text":"你告诉他，<style=\"highlight\">班题斯圣器已经不在锈锚港了</style>。","source_cn":"你告诉他，<style=highlight>班题斯圣器...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3BCF17E932EBBF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222677007:1":{"text":"就算他派人来也毫无意义，只会得不偿失。","source_cn":"就算他派人来也毫无意义，只会得不偿失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40F734A4DD16B617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222677008:1":{"text":"好……我会转达，但我不许诺结果。","source_cn":"好……我会转达，但我不许诺结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CDEE0BD82EE58A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222677009:1":{"text":"没关系，如果你的雇主不依不饶，锈锚港也不会坐以待毙。","source_cn":"没关系，如果你的雇主不依不饶，锈锚港也不会坐以待毙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7FD2AA8A336A9EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222677010:1":{"text":"这一句，我也会一并转达。","source_cn":"这一句，我也会一并转达。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE1368B7FA6A084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222677011:1":{"text":"但……我很好奇，为什么？","source_cn":"但……我很好奇，为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32DB31C27F5AE69B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222677012:1":{"text":"为什么放了你？还是，为什么让你带口信？","source_cn":"为什么放了你？还是，为什么让你带口信？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B7025D212A7ECA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222677013:1":{"text":"都有。我说不定会偷换口信的内容，煽风点火。","source_cn":"都有。我说不定会偷换口信的内容，煽风点火。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C058A697627A45C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222677014:0":{"text":"也有可能，我会带着骸骨之王的亡灵军团重返锈锚港。","source_cn":"也有可能，我会带着骸骨之王的亡灵军团重返锈锚港。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6343C7F7285B3E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222677015:1":{"text":"区区死潮舰队，根本无法与那位君王座下的亡灵军团相提并论。","source_cn":"区区死潮舰队，根本无法与那位君王座下的亡灵军团相提并论。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB3DD337D38AC8D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222677016:1":{"text":"原来你能一次性说这么多话啊，哈哈哈哈！","source_cn":"原来你能一次性说这么多话啊，哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F618BED763D1C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222677017:1":{"text":"还以为你得了一次多说几句话就会死掉的病。","source_cn":"还以为你得了一次多说几句话就会死掉的病。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC81998054F51125","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222677018:1":{"text":"不过，亡灵也不会再死一次了。","source_cn":"不过，亡灵也不会再死一次了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FB6CA214756F460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222677019:1":{"text":"……？\n亡灵，不会生病。","source_cn":"……？\\n亡灵，不会生病。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3BCD01BEF3CC3A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222677020:1":{"text":"亡灵也没有幽默感。","source_cn":"亡灵也没有幽默感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA84217FEA3F3FFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222677021:1":{"text":"你还没有回答我的问题。","source_cn":"你还没有回答我的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D389F41CCEDB19A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222677022:1":{"text":"……问原因的话，因为我生命里也有一位重要的女性。","source_cn":"……问原因的话，因为我生命里也有一位重要的女性。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495BCFD028A53D28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222677023:1":{"text":"我是人类，而她，成为了亡灵。我们的相处称不上愉快，但……那是一段无法忘却的回忆。","source_cn":"我是人类，而她，成为了亡灵。我们的相处称不上愉快，但…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57AD2F731D8976DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222677024:1":{"text":"我不知道你对女性手下留情的原因，至少，那是你行动的某种原则，对吧？","source_cn":"我不知道你对女性手下留情的原因，至少，那是你行动的某种...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AF787EE2DCBEFEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222677025:1":{"text":"当你面临性命之危和圣器被夺的风险时，你也不愿意改变自己的原则。","source_cn":"当你面临性命之危和圣器被夺的风险时，你也不愿意改变自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC2276FDABE7B24A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222677026:1":{"text":"那对你而言，只是个有着一面之缘的普通人，你却愿意为了救她而被我俘虏。","source_cn":"那对你而言，只是个有着一面之缘的普通人，你却愿意为了救...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5857C0C4FC5F9453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222677027:1":{"text":"一个能够坚定原则的亡灵，她的承诺值得信任——我是这么想的。","source_cn":"一个能够坚定原则的亡灵，她的承诺值得信任——我是这么想的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94C218BD0334149C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1222677028:1":{"text":"说到底，我也是个女性，难道我被排除在你的原则之外吗？","source_cn":"说到底，我也是个女性，难道我被排除在你的原则之外吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA983EBA8E531F92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222677029:1":{"text":"女性？看不出来。","source_cn":"女性？看不出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF81A1D5BCC2D93D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222677030:1":{"text":"……刚才那一句，是开玩笑的。","source_cn":"……刚才那一句，是开玩笑的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7DF21B74991D022","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1222677031:1":{"text":"呵……我收回那句评价，你的幽默感不多，但起码不为零。","source_cn":"呵……我收回那句评价，你的幽默感不多，但起码不为零。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE18136AA6F01E000","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222677032:1":{"text":"好了，上船吧。","source_cn":"好了，上船吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5E19AC05F2933BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:12